<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TH" style="id">- Gamo Full Bible final version</book>
  <para style="h">2Tasolonqe Asaas</para>
  <para style="toc1">Phawuloosi Tasolonqe Asaas Xaafida Nam7anththo Kiita</para>
  <para style="toc2">2Tasolonqe Asaas</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Taso</para>
  <para style="mt2">Phawuloosi</para>
  <para style="mt1">Tasolonqe Asaas</para>
  <para style="mt2">Xaafida Nam7anththo Kiita</para>
  <para style="imt1">Giddo Qofa</para>
  <para style="ip">Kirstoosi nam7anththo yaanayssa gishshas oyshaynne ooshshi dendida gishshas Tasolonqe Woosa Keeththaa garsan metoy dari dari bides. Phawuloosi Tasolonqe asaas xaafida nam7anththo kiitay, «Godaa yuussaa gallassi matides» giza ammano qaala qonccisi yootides. Phawuloosi xaafishe Kirstoosi yaanaappe kasetidi, «Makkalla as» geetettizaadey Kirstoosara eqettizaadey baleththon hayssa alameza bolla iitateththinne makkallay dari dari baana guussan istta ammano giigsanaas dafettees.</para>
  <para style="ip">Nababizayti waayeynne metoy istta bolla darikkoka istti ba ammanon minni eqqana mala Phawuloosinne harati izara issife ooththizayti ooththiza mala isttika ba duussas koshshizayssa demmanaas minni ooththana malanne lo7o ooso ooththanaas azallontta mala istta lo7eththi zorees.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ha Maxaafay Oykkida Kumeththa Qofa</para>
  <para style="io1">Geloso <char style="ior"><ref loc="2TH 1:1-2">1:1-2</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Galatanne hadara imo <char style="ior"><ref loc="2TH 1:3-12">1:3-12</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kirstoosa nam7anththo yuussaa gishshas imettida timirte <char style="ior"><ref loc="2TH 2:1-17">2:1-17</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ammanon duussa gishshas imettida zore <char style="ior"><ref loc="2TH 3:1-15">3:1-15</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kuushsha qofa <char style="ior"><ref loc="2TH 3:16-18">3:16-18</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TH 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 1:1"/>Phawuloosappe, Silwaanoosappenne Ximtoosappe; nu Aawaa Xoossaninne Godaa Yesus Kirstoosan gidida Tasolonqen ammaniza asaas,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 17:1">Hawa 17:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2TH 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 1:2"/>Xoossaa Aawappenne Godaa Yesus Kirstoosappe kiyateththinne saroteththi inttes gido.<verse eid="2TH 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Galatanne Woosa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 1:3"/>Ta ishatoo! Intte ammanoy wodeppe woden dicci dicci biza gishshassinne intte siiqoykka kaseppe gujetti gujetti biza gishshas nu intte gishshas Xoossa lo7eththi galatanaas bessees. <verse eid="2TH 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 1:4"/>Hessa gishshas intte bolla gakkida goodeteththaninne meto ubbaan intte minnida gishshas nuni nu baggara intte dandayaa gishshassinne intte ammano gishshas ammaniza asa ubbaa achchan ceeqettoos.<verse eid="2TH 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 1:5"/>Hessi wurikka Xoossa pirday suure gididayssa bessees; hessa gaason waaye be7iza intte Xoossa Kawoteththas bessizayta gidi beettideta. <verse eid="2TH 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 1:6"/>Xoossi xillo gidida gishshas inttena waayisizayta izi waayisana. <verse eid="2TH 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 1:7"/>Waaye ekkida inttessinne nuus shempo immana; hessika Godaa Yesus Kirstoosi wolqqama salo Xoossa kiitanchchatara salo bolla qoncciza wode hanana. <verse eid="2TH 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 1:8"/>He wode Xoos erontta asatanne Godaa Yesus Kirstoosa Mishiraachcho qaalaas azazettontta asata bolla izi ba halo kessana. <verse eid="2TH 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 1:9"/>Isttika Godaa sinththafenne iza bonchcho wolqqaa achchafe kichchidi mernaas dhayon qaxxayettana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 17:1">Hawa 17:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2TH 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 1:10"/>Istti qaxxayettanay izi geeshshata achchan bonchchettanaassinne ammanizayti wuri izan malalettana mala izi yiza gallassan hanana; intteka he ammaniza asaara daana; gaasoykka nu inttes markkattidayssa intte ammanida gishshassa.<verse eid="2TH 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 1:11"/>Nu hessa qoppishe nu Xoossi inttena ba xeyssaas gidizayta histti qoodana mala intte lo7o ooththanaas amottiza amozanne ammanon intte ooththida oosoza ubbaa izi inttes ba wolqqan polana mala nu inttes ubba wode woossoos. <verse eid="2TH 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 1:12"/>Qasseka nu Godaa Xoossaanne nu Godaa Yesus Kirstoosa kiyateththaa mala Yesus Kirstoosa sunththi intte achchan bonchchettana malanne intteka izan bonchchettana mala nu inttes woossoos.<verse eid="2TH 1:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TH 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Makkalla As</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 2:1"/>Ta ishatoo! Godaa Yesus Kirstoosa yuussaa gishshassinne nu izakko baana buussaa gishshas nu inttena qofsoos.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 4:15-17">1Taso 4:15-17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2TH 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 2:2"/>Ayanay qonccisides woykko qaalay gees giidi woykko nuuppe inttes kiitettida kiitaa mala, «Godaa yuussaa gallassi gakkides» giidi intte qofan yark yarkoftenne dagammofte. <verse eid="2TH 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 2:3"/>Oonikka ay hanonkka inttena baleththofo. Daro asay ammano kaddanaappe sinththe dhayanaas bessiza issi makkalla asi qonccontta dishin he gallassay gakkenna. <verse eid="2TH 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 2:4"/>Izikka Xoos geetetti goynnettiza eeqa xoossata ubbaafe bollara bana dhoqqu dhoqqu histtizaadenne Xoossara eqettizaade; izikka Xoossa Keeththan uttidi bana, «Tani Xoossa» giidi awajja awajjisana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 28:2">Hizi 28:2</ref></char></note><verse eid="2TH 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 2:5"/>Ta inttenara diza wode hayta ha yo7ota inttes ta yootidayssi inttes qofettizeesha? <verse eid="2TH 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 2:6"/>Izi ba woden qonccana gakkanaas ha7i izi qonccontta mala aazi diggizaakko intte ereeta.<verse eid="2TH 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 2:7"/>Makkallanchcha xuuray haray attoshin ha7ikka ooso bolla dees; gido attiin hayssi hananay izi ha7i ooththontta mala iza diggizaadey iza ogeppe kichchana gakkanaas xalla. <verse eid="2TH 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 2:8"/>Hessafekka kaallidi Godaa Yesusi ba doona peenoninne ba bonchcho yuussaan dhayssana; makkallanchchay qonccana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 11:4">Isa 11:4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2TH 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 2:9"/>He makkallanchcha yuussi Xala7e wolqqan hessika as baleththiza malaatataninne malalisiza miishshatan hanana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:24">Mato 24:24</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2TH 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 2:10"/>Hessaththoka ekki attontta mala tumaa ixxidi dhayza asata baleththanaas dumma dumma iita oosoy yaana. <verse eid="2TH 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 2:11"/>Hessa gaason istti wordo yo7o ammanana mala Xoossi istta bolla bala ooso kiittana. <verse eid="2TH 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 2:12"/>Hessi hananay tumaa ammanontta ixxidi wordo yo7on ufayettizayti wuri pirdettanaassa.<verse eid="2TH 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Minni Eqqite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 2:13"/>Godaan dosettida ta ishatoo! Nu gidikko ubba wode intte gishshas Xoos galatanaas nuus bessees; gaasoykka Xoossi inttena koyroppe oykkidi intte Xillo Ayanan dummatidaytanne tumu ammanidi intte attana mala inttena doorides. <verse eid="2TH 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 2:14"/>Nu Godaa Yesus Kirstoosi bonchcho gishettizayta intte gidana mala nu yootida mishiraachcho qaalaa baggara inttena xeygides. <verse eid="2TH 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 2:15"/>Hessa gishshas ta ishatoo! Intte minni eqqite; nuni nu doonan gidiin woykko kiitan woykko nu inttes aaththi yeddida timirteza lo7eththi oykkite.<verse eid="2TH 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 2:16"/>Izi nu Godaa Yesus Kirstoosi qasse nuna siiqidaynne ba kiyateththan mernaa minththeththonne lo7o hidota izi nuus immida nu Aawaa Xoossay, <verse eid="2TH 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 2:17"/>izi intte wozina lo7o oosoninne qaalan minththo.<verse eid="2TH 2:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TH 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Woosa Gishshas Shiiqida Oysho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 3:1"/>Wurseththan ta ishatoo! Qasseka Godaa qaalay intte achchan hanoyssaththoka eleli ubbaso gakkana malanne bonchchettana mala nuus woossite. <verse eid="2TH 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 3:2"/>Qasseka asi wuri ammanizayssa gidontta gishshas makkallanchchatappenne iita asatappe nu attana mala nuus woossite. <verse eid="2TH 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 3:3"/>Goday gidikko ammanettidayssa; izikka inttena minththana; Xala7eppeka inttena naagana. <verse eid="2TH 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 3:4"/>Nu inttena azazidayssa intte ha7i ooththideta shin sinththafekka intte ooththanayssa nuni Godaan ammanettoos. <verse eid="2TH 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 3:5"/>Goday intte wozina Xoossa siiqookkonne Kirstoosa dandayaakko kaaleththo.<verse eid="2TH 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ooso Ooththana Mala Imettida Zore</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 3:6"/>Ta ishatoo! Ooso ooththontta asaappenne intte nuuppe ekkida timirteza mala dontta ammanizaytappe intte haakkana mala Godaa Yesus Kirstoosa sunththan inttena nu azazoos. <verse eid="2TH 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 3:7"/>Intte nu leemiso wostti kaallanaakko intte intte baggara ereeta; nu inttenara diza wode ooso ooththontta coo de7ibeekko. <verse eid="2TH 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 3:8"/>Qasseka oona sooppeka kath coo mela mibeekko; qasse inttefe oonaska nu tooho gidontta mala qammanne gallas daaburan ooththi midos. <verse eid="2TH 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 3:9"/>Nu hessa ooththiday intte nuna kaallana mala inttes lo7o leemiso gidana giidippe attiin nuus koshshizayssa inttefe ekkanayssa nuna diggiza wogay diin gidenna. <verse eid="2TH 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 3:10"/>Nu inttenara diza wode, «Ooso ooththanaas dosontta asi kath mooppo» giza azazo inttes immidos. <verse eid="2TH 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 3:11"/>Intte giddon issi issi asati ooso ooththonttayssa nu siyidos; heytantti ooso ooththontta mela asa yo7on geliza asata. <verse eid="2TH 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 3:12"/>Heyta mala asati ba ooso co7u gi ooththana malanne ba kath maana mala Godaa Yesus Kirstoosa sunththan nu istta azazoossinne zoroos. <verse eid="2TH 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 3:13"/>Intte gidikko ta ishatoo! Lo7o ooso ooththanaappe mulekka azallofte. <verse eid="2TH 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 3:14"/>Hayssa nu kiittida qaalaas azazettonttay oonikka diikko hessa misatizaade lo7eththi kaallitenne izi ba ooson yeellatana mala izara gaaggofte. <verse eid="2TH 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 3:15"/>Gido attiin iza intte isha mala hanqite attiin morkke mala xeellofte.<verse eid="2TH 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wurseththa Saroka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 3:16"/>Saroteththaa Goday izi ba baggara yo7o ubbaan inttes saroteth immo; Goday inttenara ubbaara gido. <verse eid="2TH 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 3:17"/>Hayssa sarokaa tani ta kushera inttes xaafiday tana Phawuloosa. Ta kiitaas dumma malatay hayssa; izikka hayssa tani ta kushen xaafoyssa. <verse eid="2TH 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TH 3:18"/>Nu Godaa Yesus Kirstoosa aadho kiyateththi inttenara ubbaara gido.<verse eid="2TH 3:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 3"/>
</usx>
